<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Set up Job Hunter</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script>tailwind.config={theme:{extend:{colors:{ink:'#102a43',accent:'#0f766e'},fontFamily:{display:['IBM Plex Sans','ui-sans-serif','system-ui']}}}}</script>
<style>html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{font-family:"IBM Plex Sans",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.step:target{outline:3px solid #99f6e4;outline-offset:3px}</style></head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-100 text-ink"><%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl space-y-5 px-4 py-6">
  <% if (error) { %><div class="rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-800"><%= error %></div><% } %>
  <% if (success) { %><div class="rounded-xl border border-teal-200 bg-teal-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-teal-900"><%= success %></div><% } %>
  <section class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-teal-900 p-6 text-white shadow-lg">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] md:items-end"><div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-teal-200">Set up once</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">Your application workspace</h1><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-200">Job Hunter matches relevant roles, prepares job-specific documents, fills verified details, and sends only unresolved decisions to Attention Center. You always review before submitting.</p></div>
    <div><div class="flex justify-between text-sm font-semibold"><span><%= onboarding.completed %> of <%= onboarding.total %> ready</span><span><%= onboarding.percent %>%</span></div><div class="mt-2 h-3 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/20"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-teal-300" style="width:<%= onboarding.percent %>%"></div></div><% if (onboarding.next) { %><a href="<%= onboarding.next.href %>" class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-bold text-teal-200 underline">Continue: <%= onboarding.next.label %></a><% } %></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <% onboarding.steps.forEach(function(step, index){ %><a href="<%= step.href %>" class="rounded-xl border <%= step.complete ? 'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50' : 'border-slate-200 bg-white' %> p-4 hover:border-teal-400"><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full <%= step.complete ? 'bg-emerald-600 text-white' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600' %> font-bold"><%= step.complete ? '✓' : index + 1 %></span><div><strong class="block"><%= step.label %></strong><span class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500"><%= step.description %></span></div></div></a><% }) %>
  </section>

  <section id="resume" class="step rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] md:items-center"><div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Step 1</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold">Start from your resume</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Upload a master PDF. Job Hunter extracts a structured, reviewable profile while preserving field evidence and confidence. Confirmed data becomes the application profile; the editable structured master remains the tailoring source.</p></div><form id="onboardingResume" class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-4"><input name="resume" type="file" accept="application/pdf" required class="w-full rounded-lg border bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm"><button class="mt-3 w-full rounded-lg bg-accent px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">Upload and inspect resume</button><p id="resumeStatus" class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500"></p></form></div>
    <% const rp = onboarding.resumeProfile; if (rp) { %><div class="mt-5 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Resume understanding</p><h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold"><%= rp.completeness %>% structured · <%= Math.round((rp.confidence || 0) * 100) %>% confidence</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Verify this once. Applications then use these facts locally before considering AI.</p></div><span class="rounded-full <%= rp.candidateConfirmed ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-900' %> px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold"><%= rp.candidateConfirmed ? 'Verified' : 'Needs your review' %></span></div>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Experience</span><strong class="mt-1 block"><%= rp.career.totalExperienceYears ?? '—' %> years</strong></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Roles</span><strong class="mt-1 block"><%= rp.career.roleCount %></strong></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Education</span><strong class="mt-1 block"><%= rp.career.educationCount %></strong></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Skills</span><strong class="mt-1 block"><%= rp.skills.length %></strong></div></div>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><h4 class="font-bold">Experience timeline</h4><div class="mt-2 space-y-2"><% rp.experience.slice(0, 8).forEach(function(role){ %><div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3"><strong><%= role.title || 'Role' %></strong><span class="block text-sm text-slate-600"><%= role.company %><%= role.location ? ' · ' + role.location : '' %></span><span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-slate-500"><%= role.startDate || '?' %> – <%= role.endDate || '?' %> · <%= role.bullets.length %> verified highlight(s)</span></div><% }) %><% if (!rp.experience.length) { %><p class="text-sm text-amber-800">The PDF text did not expose reliable role boundaries. Add or verify them in your profile.</p><% } %></div></div>
      <div><h4 class="font-bold">Education</h4><div class="mt-2 space-y-2"><% rp.education.slice(0, 6).forEach(function(item){ %><div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3"><strong><%= item.degree || item.field || 'Education' %></strong><span class="block text-sm text-slate-600"><%= item.institution %></span><span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-slate-500"><%= item.startDate || '?' %> – <%= item.endDate || '?' %></span></div><% }) %><% if (!rp.education.length) { %><p class="text-sm text-amber-800">No reliable education entry was extracted.</p><% } %></div></div></div>
      <div class="mt-4"><h4 class="font-bold">Detected skills</h4><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><% rp.skills.slice(0, 40).forEach(function(skill){ %><span class="rounded-full bg-teal-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-800"><%= skill %></span><% }) %></div></div>
      <% if (rp.warnings && rp.warnings.length) { %><div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4"><strong class="text-sm text-amber-900">Verify before promotion</strong><ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-xs text-amber-900"><% rp.warnings.forEach(function(warning){ %><li><%= warning %></li><% }) %></ul></div><% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/onboarding/resume-profile/confirm" class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-4"><div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-sm font-semibold">Suggested target roles<input name="targetRoles" value="<%= rp.searchSuggestions.targetRoles.join(', ') %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border bg-white px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="text-sm font-semibold">Preferred search skills<input name="preferredSkills" value="<%= rp.preferredSkills.join(', ') %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border bg-white px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label></div><button class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white"><%= rp.candidateConfirmed ? 'Update verified resume profile' : 'Confirm these resume details' %></button></form>
    </div><% } %></section>

  <form id="profile" method="POST" action="/onboarding/profile" class="step rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Step 2</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold">Verify your core profile</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">These verified details can be filled automatically. You can edit them before every submission.</p><% if (onboarding.profileReadiness.missingRequired.length || onboarding.profileReadiness.missingRecommended.length) { %><div class="mt-3 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-3 text-sm text-amber-950"><strong>Profile readiness</strong><% if (onboarding.profileReadiness.missingRequired.length) { %><p class="mt-1">Required for reliable autofill: <%= onboarding.profileReadiness.missingRequired.join(', ') %>.</p><% } %><% if (onboarding.profileReadiness.missingRecommended.length) { %><p class="mt-1">Recommended: <%= onboarding.profileReadiness.missingRecommended.join(', ') %>.</p><% } %></div><% } %><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm md:grid-cols-2">
    <label class="font-semibold">Full name<input name="name" required value="<%= profile.name %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Email<input name="email" type="email" required value="<%= profile.email %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Preferred first name<input name="preferredFirstName" value="<%= profile.preferredFirstName %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Preferred family name<input name="preferredLastName" value="<%= profile.preferredLastName %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Legal first name<input name="legalFirstName" value="<%= profile.legalFirstName %>" autocomplete="given-name" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Legal middle name<input name="legalMiddleName" value="<%= profile.legalMiddleName %>" autocomplete="additional-name" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Legal family name<input name="legalLastName" value="<%= profile.legalLastName %>" autocomplete="family-name" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><span class="self-end pb-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Used only when the employer explicitly asks for legal name.</span>
    <label class="font-semibold">Phone<input name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" value="<%= profile.phone %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Current city / town<input name="currentLocation" required value="<%= profile.currentLocation %>" placeholder="Gurugram, Haryana" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Country<input name="country" required value="<%= profile.country || 'India' %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Postal / PIN code<input name="postalCode" value="<%= profile.postalCode %>" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autocomplete="postal-code" aria-describedby="pin-help" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"><small id="pin-help" class="mt-1 block font-normal text-slate-500">Required for Indian address fields; exactly 6 digits.</small></label>
    <label class="font-semibold md:col-span-2">Address line 1<input name="addressLine1" value="<%= profile.addressLine1 %>" autocomplete="address-line1" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold md:col-span-2">Address line 2 (optional)<input name="addressLine2" value="<%= profile.addressLine2 %>" autocomplete="address-line2" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Address city<input name="addressCity" value="<%= profile.addressCity %>" autocomplete="address-level2" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">State / union territory<input name="addressState" value="<%= profile.addressState %>" autocomplete="address-level1" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Current company<input name="currentCompany" value="<%= profile.currentCompany %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Current industry<input name="currentIndustry" value="<%= profile.currentIndustry %>" placeholder="Fintech, Edtech, SaaS" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Total experience (years)<input name="totalExperienceYears" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="<%= profile.totalExperienceYears ?? '' %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">LinkedIn URL<input name="linkedinUrl" type="url" value="<%= profile.linkedinUrl %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">GitHub URL<input name="githubUrl" type="url" value="<%= profile.githubUrl %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Portfolio URL<input name="portfolioUrl" type="url" value="<%= profile.portfolioUrl %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Work authorization (candidate-verified)<select name="workAuthorization" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"><option value="">Ask per application</option><option value="AUTHORIZED" <%= profile.workAuthorization === 'AUTHORIZED' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Authorized in India</option><option value="OTHER" <%= profile.workAuthorization === 'OTHER' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Other / review each application</option></select></label><label class="font-semibold">Need employer sponsorship?<select name="sponsorshipRequired" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"><option value="">Ask per application</option><option value="NO" <%= profile.sponsorshipRequired === 'NO' ? 'selected' : '' %>>No</option><option value="YES" <%= profile.sponsorshipRequired === 'YES' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Yes</option></select></label></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-amber-800">Authorization and sponsorship stay local and are filled only when the employer wording maps exactly. Legal attestations, consent, signatures and demographic questions still require review.</p><button class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">Save and continue</button>
  </form>

  <form id="preferences" method="POST" action="/onboarding/preferences" class="step rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Step 3</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold">Set your Indian job-search boundaries</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">These choices improve scoring and stop attractive-but-impossible roles from becoming close matches.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm md:grid-cols-2">
    <fieldset class="md:col-span-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4"><legend class="px-2 font-bold">Career profiles to search</legend><p class="mb-3 text-xs text-slate-500">Select every family you genuinely want. Capability and preference are scored separately.</p><div class="grid gap-2 md:grid-cols-3"><% careerProfiles.forEach(function(item){ %><label class="flex gap-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-3"><input type="checkbox" name="careerProfiles" value="<%= item.key %>" <%= profile.careerProfiles.includes(item.key) ? 'checked' : '' %>><span><strong class="block"><%= item.label %></strong><small class="text-slate-500"><%= item.description %></small></span></label><% }) %></div></fieldset>
    <label class="font-semibold md:col-span-2">Target roles<input name="targetRoles" required value="<%= profile.targetRoles.join(', ') %>" placeholder="Backend Engineer, Node.js Engineer" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold md:col-span-2">Preferred job-search skills<input name="preferredSkills" value="<%= profile.preferredSkills.join(', ') %>" placeholder="Node.js, APIs, AWS" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold md:col-span-2">Skills to avoid in recommendations<input name="excludedSkills" value="<%= profile.excludedSkills.join(', ') %>" placeholder="Cold calling, WordPress" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold md:col-span-2">Preferred locations<input name="preferredLocations" required value="<%= profile.preferredLocations.join(', ') %>" placeholder="Bengaluru, Gurugram, Remote" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Work modes<input name="preferredWorkModes" value="<%= profile.preferredWorkModes.join(', ') %>" placeholder="Remote, Hybrid" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Notice period (days)<input name="noticePeriodDays" type="number" min="0" value="<%= profile.noticePeriodDays %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Last working date (when confirmed)<input name="lastWorkingDate" type="date" value="<%= profile.lastWorkingDate %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"><small class="mt-1 block font-normal text-slate-500">Leave blank while employed unless this date is confirmed; it expires from autofill after 30 days.</small></label><span class="self-end pb-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Start-date questions remain application-specific and are never inferred from this date.</span>
    <label class="font-semibold">Current CTC (optional, LPA)<input name="currentCTC" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="<%= profile.currentCTC ?? '' %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Expected CTC (LPA)<input name="expectedCTC" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="<%= profile.expectedCTC ?? '' %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="font-semibold">Minimum acceptable CTC (LPA)<input name="minimumSalary" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="<%= profile.minimumSalary ?? '' %>" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label><label class="font-semibold">Excluded companies<input name="excludedCompanies" value="<%= settings.excludedCompanies.join(', ') %>" placeholder="Companies you do not want" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 font-normal"></label>
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold md:col-span-2"><input type="checkbox" name="willingToRelocate" value="1" <%= profile.willingToRelocate ? 'checked' : '' %>> I am willing to relocate</label></div><button class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">Save boundaries</button>
  </form>

  <form id="privacy" method="POST" action="/onboarding/privacy" class="step rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Step 4</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold">Choose privacy and learning settings</h2><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3">
    <label class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4"><input type="checkbox" name="aiProcessingConsent" value="1" <%= profile.aiProcessingConsent ? 'checked' : '' %>><span><strong class="block">AI answers on applications</strong><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">When leftover writing has no verified profile answer, draft it from your resume. You still review and submit. Protected fields stay local. This will be a paid feature later.</span></span></label>
    <label class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4"><input type="checkbox" name="reusableAnswerConsent" value="1" <%= profile.reusableAnswerConsent ? 'checked' : '' %>><span><strong class="block">Learn quietly from completed applications</strong><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Eligible low-risk answers are considered only after verified completion. Consequential changes require review, and every application can opt out without blocking autofill.</span></span></label>
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-amber-950"><strong>Direct candidate actions in this build:</strong> government IDs, banking, health/diversity disclosures, declarations, signatures, OTP, CAPTCHA, and final submission. Declarations are application-specific and never reusable profile memory.</div></div><button class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">Save privacy choices</button>
  </form>

  <section id="extension" class="step rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Step 5</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold">Connect COPILOT after the value preview</h2><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 p-4"><strong class="text-emerald-800">Filled automatically</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Verified contact, profile, and professional facts.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-amber-50 p-4"><strong class="text-amber-800">Sent to Attention Center</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Unknown mappings, conflicts, uploads, and decisions needing you.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-100 p-4"><strong>Never submitted</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">You review and submit directly on the employer form.</p></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Reload the unpacked extension, open a job from Job Hunter, then choose <strong>Enable autofill on all job sites</strong> when Chrome asks. COPILOT activates only for linked application sessions.</p><form method="POST" action="/onboarding/extension" class="mt-3"><input type="hidden" name="extensionReady" value="1"><button class="rounded-lg border border-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-accent">I have connected COPILOT</button></form></section>

  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-teal-200 bg-teal-50 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Start your first guided application</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Choose a strong match, open it with COPILOT, and use Attention Center for anything unfinished.</p></div><div class="flex gap-2"><a href="/?panel=matches" class="rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">View matched jobs</a><a href="/attention" class="rounded-lg border border-accent px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-accent">Attention Center</a></div></div></section>
</main><script>
document.getElementById('onboardingResume').addEventListener('submit',async function(event){event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget;const button=form.querySelector('button');const status=document.getElementById('resumeStatus');button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Inspecting your PDF…';try{const response=await fetch('/api/resume',{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form)});const result=await response.json().catch(()=>({}));if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Upload failed.');status.textContent=`Resume ready · ${result.pageCount} page(s) · ${result.textLength} characters extracted`;setTimeout(()=>location.reload(),600)}catch(error){status.textContent=error.message;button.disabled=false}});
</script></body></html>
